  REMIX - reactive transport chemistry output
  For each output time step, one labelled block per requested variable:
    conc       : aqueous variable-activity species concentrations, then all component concentrations U*c (all output waters)
    conc_mix   : aqueous variable-activity species concentrations of the conservative mix (previous-step concentrations mixed; for the by-zones mixers including the previous-step kinetic term), then all component concentrations U*c_mix (target waters only, t>0)
    conc_hat   : aqueous variable-activity species concentrations of the mixed waters entering the Newton speciation (mix + previous-step reaction terms of all mixing waters + current-step reaction terms of the mixing waters except the water itself), then all component concentrations U*c_hat (target waters only, t>0)
    react_rate : equilibrium/kinetic reaction rates (target waters only)
    min-to-pore : mineral-to-pore volume ratios V_min/V_pore (target waters only)
    abs_cum_react_amnt : absolute cumulative reaction amounts (target waters only); mineral columns in kg (amount in mol times the molecular weight of the mineral, 0 if the database gives none), the other columns in mol
    Each block: header row (water index + species/component names) followed by one row per requested output water

